<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vivek Kumar | VK Digital</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fc;
            color: #172033;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #071b40;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        header h2 {
            color: #61c4ff;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 18px;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #071b40, #1558a6);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 75px 20px;
        }

        .profile {
            width: 125px;
            height: 125px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #1558a6;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 4px solid #61c4ff;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #61c4ff;
            color: #071b40;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            padding: 50px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #0c3675;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 260px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #00000010;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #1558a6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        #contact {
            background: #e7effb;
        }

        footer {
            background: #071b40;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 6px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 29px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h2>VK Digital</h2>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="profile">VK</div>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Vivek Kumar</h1>
        <p>Digital Service Provider | Computer Services</p>
        <a class="button" href="#about">Know More About Me</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hello! I am Vivek Kumar, a Digital Service Provider.
            I am interested in computer technology, online services,
            and helping people with their digital needs.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
        <h2>My Services & Skills</h2>
        <div class="card-container">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Online Services</h3>
                <p>Assistance with digital services and online applications.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Document Services</h3>
                <p>PDF, photo, document formatting, and basic computer work.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Website Learning</h3>
                <p>Learning HTML and building websites.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <p>For professional enquiries, please contact me.</p>
        <p>Email: Add your email address here</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 VK Digital | Vivek Kumar</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
